    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PACK is a first person cleaning game where you play as a robot designed to clean up after natural disasters. The only problem is that the world has already ended \u2013 but that\u2019s never stopped a robot from carrying out its objective. Wash, vacuum and clean out old abandoned structures while learning about the ultimate fate of mankind, alone or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Washing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The handy washer is used to wash away various grimes, stains or even blood. While the washer can be used to push objects around, there are better tools for that job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/925261850ce1a4df789ae71a9dbb2195.poster.avif?t=1753534158\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/925261850ce1a4df789ae71a9dbb2195.webm?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/925261850ce1a4df789ae71a9dbb2195.mp4?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vacuuming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vacuum is used to suck up small items as well as surface materials like leaves and papers. The vacuum, however, has a capacity limit. When the vacuum becomes full you will generate a trash cube that will need to be picked up and disposed of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/eef330a78e2df5418483af46c7bf5026.poster.avif?t=1753534158\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/eef330a78e2df5418483af46c7bf5026.webm?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/eef330a78e2df5418483af46c7bf5026.mp4?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The graspers are used to pick up and recycle trash cubes and other trash too big for the vacuum. Recycled items provide resources that can be used to repair broken objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/5c13188f33a49bc941f35e243a50882e.poster.avif?t=1753534158\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/5c13188f33a49bc941f35e243a50882e.webm?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/5c13188f33a49bc941f35e243a50882e.mp4?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Repair</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your acquired resources to repair broken objects and restore plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/0867da83d4efbcee27e0d4036dbbe440.poster.avif?t=1753534158\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/0867da83d4efbcee27e0d4036dbbe440.webm?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/0867da83d4efbcee27e0d4036dbbe440.mp4?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean dirt and grime using the spray washer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remove litter using the vacuum and generate trash cubes for easy disposal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickup and dispose of debris and trash cubes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use recycled resources to repair damages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean and restore multiple levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover story elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 3 friends in multiplayer mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PACK is a first person cleaning game where you play as a robot designed to clean up after natural disasters. The only problem is that the world has already ended \u2013 but that\u2019s never stopped a robot from carrying out its objective. Wash, vacuum and clean out old abandoned structures while learning about the ultimate fate of mankind, alone or with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Washing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The handy washer is used to wash away various grimes, stains or even blood. While the washer can be used to push objects around, there are better tools for that job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/925261850ce1a4df789ae71a9dbb2195.poster.avif?t=1753534158\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/925261850ce1a4df789ae71a9dbb2195.webm?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/925261850ce1a4df789ae71a9dbb2195.mp4?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vacuuming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vacuum is used to suck up small items as well as surface materials like leaves and papers. The vacuum, however, has a capacity limit. When the vacuum becomes full you will generate a trash cube that will need to be picked up and disposed of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/eef330a78e2df5418483af46c7bf5026.poster.avif?t=1753534158\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/eef330a78e2df5418483af46c7bf5026.webm?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/eef330a78e2df5418483af46c7bf5026.mp4?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The graspers are used to pick up and recycle trash cubes and other trash too big for the vacuum. Recycled items provide resources that can be used to repair broken objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/5c13188f33a49bc941f35e243a50882e.poster.avif?t=1753534158\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/5c13188f33a49bc941f35e243a50882e.webm?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/5c13188f33a49bc941f35e243a50882e.mp4?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Repair</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your acquired resources to repair broken objects and restore plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/0867da83d4efbcee27e0d4036dbbe440.poster.avif?t=1753534158\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/0867da83d4efbcee27e0d4036dbbe440.webm?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3286440/extras/0867da83d4efbcee27e0d4036dbbe440.mp4?t=1753534158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean dirt and grime using the spray washer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remove litter using the vacuum and generate trash cubes for easy disposal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickup and dispose of debris and trash cubes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use recycled resources to repair damages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean and restore multiple levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover story elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 3 friends in multiplayer mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
